  "disclosed_repaired_attempts": [
    "First 33-case disposable history run: 32 passed and one concurrent replay failed. A focused repair still exposed an identical-insert conflict. The final insert handles both deterministic unique constraints with ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING and retries repeatable-read serialization/deadlock failures for at most three complete transactions. Final two/four-caller cases pass in the uninstrumented 35-case run.",
    "An ignored local diagnostic recorded only exception class, SQLSTATE and primary server message and observed serialization failure40001. It was not loaded for final verification; no test or assertion was disabled.",
    "A controlled cross-version negative initially used ordinary upload, which correctly rejected conflicting metadata for identical PDF bytes. The final authored negative constructs that inconsistent version directly only in the owned test database to exercise the independent context source gate; it is quarantined and never claimed as normal ingestion behavior."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Preparation history does not create public EvidenceSource/CellEvidence, complete parses, candidate/current-parse membership, mandatory M1 validation, actual review, accepted observations or corpus publication.",
    "SUPPORTED_PROPOSAL and all stored records remain acceptance_eligible=false, review_required=true and mandatory_m1_validation_complete=false. Hashes are not signatures or approval.",
    "Known current inspection code is replayed against retained inputs. Different historical configurations are read as frozen history, without interpreting them under new code. Historical reads do not establish physical PDF availability or current approval applicability.",
    "Database guards enforce fingerprints, actual approval snapshots, immutable membership, transaction ownership and preparation flags. They do not prove all financial semantics; application inspection and the future mandatory M1 path remain necessary.",
    "Narrow annual monetary grammar and all cross-page applicability limits of predecessor2307d05 remain unchanged. The four real inspections all require review; no independent gold annotation, human review or research accuracy is claimed.",
    "The original primary corpus has one conditional narrative and zero accepted numeric facts. M2 real acceptance remains BLOCKED; quotes remain unavailable by user choice. M3/M4 and integration are not advanced.",
    "Original PDFs, source captures, retained raw records, credentials, models, database state and generated artifacts remain ignored. A teammate needs an independent local setup and real published corpus; no shared deployment or populated demo importer is supplied."
  ],
  "mandatory_m1_validation_complete": false,
  "new_api_endpoints": [],
  "next_work": [
    "Connect genuine versioned M1 evidence and current-parse membership without using preparation capture IDs as public evidence IDs or relabeling sparse source pages as a complete parse.",
    "Complete mandatory numerical validation, actual source-backed review, immutable acceptance and atomic publication while preserving original M1 source/corpus and all history.",
    "Independently review real numerical expectations and close all six M2 acceptance categories. Preserve conflicts and selected corpus consistency; quotes stay unavailable."
  ],
